<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Dependent Verification Worksheet</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td, th { padding: 5px; text-align: left; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-label { font-weight: bold; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18pt;">TOUGALOO COLLEGE</h2>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">2021-2022 Dependent Verification Worksheet</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">FORM 4</h3>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p>Your financial aid application has been chosen for a review process called "Verification." Verification is a process by which <span data-field="institution_name">{{ institution_name }}</span> compares the information on your application with the IRS transcripts of you and your parent's 2019 tax return, W-2 forms, and any other financial documents. The law says that our institution has a right to ask for this information before we award you Federal aid. If there are differences in the application and the financial documents, then an electronic correction is made to your application.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 25px;">What should you do for verification?</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Complete and sign this verification worksheet.</li>
    <li>Return with this worksheet, a SIGNED IRS transcript of you and your parent's 2019 tax returns and W-2 forms.</li>
    <li>Submit the information to the financial aid office as soon as possible.</li>
    <li>Once the financial aid office has your documentation, the verification will be completed, and any corrections will be made by the financial aid office.</li>
    <li>Once verification is completed, then you can be awarded federal aid.</li>
  </ol>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 25px;">A. Student Information</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 25%;">Last Name</td>
      <td style="width: 25%;"><span data-field="first_name">{{ first_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">M.I.</td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">Social Security Number</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Address (include apt. no.)</td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td>Date of Birth</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 25px;">B. Family Information</h3>
  <p>List the people in your parents' household, include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your and your parent(s) (including stepparents) even if you don't live at home.</li>
    <li>Your parents' other children even if they don't live with your parents, if your parent will supply over fifty percent of their support from July 01, 2021 to June 30, 2022, or if the child must provide parental information when they file FAFSA.</li>
    <li>Any people that now live with your parents, if your parent will supply over half of their support from July 01, 2021 to June 30, 2022.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Write the names of all household members in the space below. Write the name of the college you or any other household member will be attending at least half time between July 01, 2020 and June 30, 2021 in a degree seeking program. Do not list a college for your parents even if they are enrolled. Their enrollment does not count according to FAFSA regulations.</p>
  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Full Name</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Age</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Relationship</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">College</td>
    </tr>
    {% for item in household_members %}
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="household_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].full_name">{{ household_members[loop.index0].full_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="household_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].age">{{ household_members[loop.index0].age }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="household_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].relationship">{{ household_members[loop.index0].relationship }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="household_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].college">{{ household_members[loop.index0].college }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">address used when the 2018 IRS tax return was filed). It takes up to two weeks for IRS income information to be available for electronic IRS tax return filers, and up to eight weeks for paper IRS tax return filers.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 25px;">D. Untaxed Income Information (please check Yes or No, and provide annual amount if yes)</h3>
  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 20%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Yes</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">No</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Annual Amount received by student</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Annual Amount received by parent</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Payment to tax-deferred pension and savings plans (paid directly or withheld from earnings)</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_pension_student">{{ untaxed_income_pension_student }}</span></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_pension_parent">{{ untaxed_income_pension_parent }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Veterans Non-Educ. Benefits</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_veterans_student">{{ untaxed_income_veterans_student }}</span></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_veterans_parent">{{ untaxed_income_veterans_parent }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Education Credits</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_credits_student">{{ untaxed_income_credits_student }}</span></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_credits_parent">{{ untaxed_income_credits_parent }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Child support</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_child_support_student">{{ untaxed_income_child_support_student }}</span></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_child_support_parent">{{ untaxed_income_child_support_parent }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Other Welfare Benefits</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_welfare_student">{{ untaxed_income_welfare_student }}</span></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_welfare_parent">{{ untaxed_income_welfare_parent }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Cash support/money paid on your behalf</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_cash_student">{{ untaxed_income_cash_student }}</span></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_cash_parent">{{ untaxed_income_cash_parent }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Housing, food, living allowances (paid to members of the military, clergy, others)</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_housing_student">{{ untaxed_income_housing_student }}</span></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="untaxed_income_housing_parent">{{ untaxed_income_housing_parent }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 25px;">Additional Untaxed Income Information</h3>
  <p>1. Did you or someone in your household, listed in Section B, receive benefits from the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program, or SNAP (formerly known as food stamps) anytime during the 2019 calendar year?</p>
  <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 10%;">Yes</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">No</td>
      <td style="width: 80%;">If yes, please provide documentation</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>2. Did you or your parent, pay child support in 2019?</p>
  <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 10%;">Yes</td>
      <td style="width: 10%;">No</td>
      <td style="width: 80%;">If yes, please provide the information below and supporting documentation</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 33%;">Name of Person Who Paid Child Support</th>
        <th style="width: 33%;">Name of Person to Whom Child Support was Paid</th>
        <th style="width: 33%;">Name of Child for Whom Child Support was Paid</th>
        <th style="width: 100%;">Amount of Child Support Paid in 2019</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in child_support_payments %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].payer_name">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].payer_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].recipient_name">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].recipient_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].child_name">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].child_name }}</span></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 25px;">E. Non-Tax Filers Information</h3>
  <p>If you or your parent did not file and are not required to file a 2019 Federal Income Tax return, list below you and your parent's employer(s) and any source of untaxed income received in 2019.</p>
  <p>I (we) did not file and are not required to file a 2019 Federal Income Tax return. (Check all that apply.)</p>
  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Student</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Parent</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Source</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="non_tax_filer_student_name">{{ non_tax_filer_student_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="non_tax_filer_parent_name">{{ non_tax_filer_parent_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="non_tax_filer_source">{{ non_tax_filer_source }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="non_tax_filer_student_employer">{{ non_tax_filer_student_employer }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="non_tax_filer_parent_employer">{{ non_tax_filer_parent_employer }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="non_tax_filer_employer_source">{{ non_tax_filer_employer_source }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Amount(s)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>$ <span data-field="non_tax_filer_amount">{{ non_tax_filer_amount }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 25px;">F. Sign this Worksheet</h3>
  <p>By signing this worksheet, I (we) certify that all the information reported on it is complete and correct.</p>
  <table style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Student</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Date</td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">Parent</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="student_signature_line">{{ student_signature_line }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_date">{{ student_date }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="parent_signature_line">{{ parent_signature_line }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="3" style="margin-top: 50px;">
        <div style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 10px; width: 100%;">
          <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">Warning: If you purposely give false or misleading information on this worksheet, you may be fined, be sentenced to jail, or both.</p>
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
    <p>Mail completed form to:</p>
    <p><span data-field="institution_mailing_address_line1">{{ institution_mailing_address_line1 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="institution_mailing_address_line2">{{ institution_mailing_address_line2 }}</span></p>
    <p>Tougaloo, MS 39174</p>
    <p>Fax: <span data-field="institution_fax_number">{{ institution_fax_number }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>